Rules:
- Labels: "causes" | "causedby" | "norel".
- A pair is "causes" or "causedby" ONLY if an explicit causality marker in the text directly
  connects the two events. No explicit marker → "norel".
- Mention IDs come from the <ID text> tags in the text (e.g. <ei3 acquired> → ID is "ei3").
- Every listed pair must appear exactly once in your JSON.
- Every "causes" entry must be accompanied by its symmetric "causedby" entry.
- Return ONLY a JSON array like:
[
  {"pair":"ei3,ei7","label":"causes"},
  {"pair":"ei7,ei3","label":"causedby"},
  {"pair":"ei2,ei3","label":"norel"}
]

